      "type": "Surface",
      "kind": "text",
      "payload": ")"
     }
    ]
   },
   "note": "binary Eq -> '(a == b)'; parens are transparent on re-read (unwrap_paren). hub Div IS lua '/' (both true division); IDiv/Mod per the P2 ledger; Pow is cross-frame only (lua reads avoid ^ per the float ledger).",
